 "final_message": "Intent to proceed is recorded with Brightpath Home Lending, and both underwriting conditions are answered. The application (BHL-26001) is now in underwriting, waiting on the lender's review.\n\n- **Loan Estimate:** It was within all three limits, so I accepted it. The rate is 7.25% (limit 7.5%), the monthly payment is $3,485.58 (limit $3,600), and closing costs are $13,200 (limit $14,500).\n- **Documents:** I sent the 12 records the lender asked for. These are the last 2 statements for each of the four personal accounts and the last 2 payslips for each of Sam and Nadia.\n- **Condition 1, the $8,000 deposit on 09/03/2026 into Sam's checking ending 4417:** I asked Sam, who said it was a gift from their parents toward the down payment, not a loan. I sent that as the written explanation.\n- **Condition 2, the 2025 W-2s:** I sent both W-2s only after the lender asked for them.\n\nI did not resubmit the application, and I shared nothing outside what Sam and Nadia authorized.",
